# What the image does not need, and what would make its build slow, fat or
# machine-dependent. `Containerfile` builds luu from source inside the image, so
# the host's own artefacts are noise at best — a `target/` from a Mac is a
# gigabyte of the wrong architecture.
target/
.git/
site/
node_modules/
tests/smoke/node_modules/
tests/smoke/test-results/
tests/smoke/playwright-report/
editors/vscode/node_modules/
editors/vscode/dist/
